
WanaagPlus 🌙

WanaagPlus is a good-deeds competition platform designed to encourage Muslims to compete in doing good deeds, inspired by the Quranic principle of فَاسْتَبِقُوا الْخَيْرَاتِ — “So race to all that is good.”

✨ Features
Tasbih Counter: Count daily dhikr and track your remembrance of Allah.
Points System: Earn points for completing dhikr and other good deeds.
Daily Competition: Compete with other users to increase your good deeds.
Top 10 Leaderboard: Display the top 10 participants with the highest points each day.
Daily Rankings: Rankings reset daily to give everyone a fresh opportunity to compete.
Progress Tracking: Monitor your daily activity and personal achievements.
Motivation & Reminders: Encourage consistency in worship and good deeds.
🎯 Purpose

The purpose of WanaagPlus is to promote good deeds, encourage consistency in dhikr, and build a community that motivates one another to do good.

🛠️ Tech Stack
Backend: NestJS
Database: PostgreSQL
ORM: Prisma
Frontend: NextJs With typeScript
🚀 Vision

WanaagPlus aims to make doing good deeds a daily habit through friendly competition, personal progress tracking, and a community centered on positive actions.

فَاسْتَبِقُوا الْخَيْرَاتِ

Race toward all that is good.